title: mfr_inode
tags: [[Reserved field]] [[What counts as a duplicate]]
kind: reference
summary: <dev>:<ino>, only on a file with more than one hard link — its presence marks a hard link.

Two files with the same `mfr_inode` are one file under two names: they are not
counted as reclaimable duplicates ([[What counts as a duplicate]]). Unix only
([[File metadata fields]]).
